---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms · Tarmoto"
  description="Prelaunch terms for the Tarmoto waitlist and marketing site."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="subpage">
    <div class="subpage-container">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-num">§</span>
        <span class="eyebrow-rule"></span>
        <span class="stamp">Terms</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="subpage-title">Terms of service.</h1>

      <p class="subpage-lede">
        Tarmoto is in early beta and the product isn't generally available yet.
        These terms cover what you can expect from this site and the waitlist
        for now. Full terms of service will follow before public launch.
      </p>

      <div class="subpage-body">
        <h2>Who you're dealing with</h2>
        <p>
          This site and the Tarmoto product are operated by
          <strong>Studio81 Labs, s.r.o.</strong>
          ("we", "us"). References to "the service" mean this marketing site
          and any prelaunch tooling we expose, including the waitlist.
        </p>

        <h2>The waitlist</h2>
        <p>
          Joining the waitlist is free and creates no obligation on either
          side. We may invite you to participate in a closed beta later, but
          there's no guarantee of access, timing, or feature availability.
          We won't charge you while the product is in beta.
        </p>

        <h2>Site content</h2>
        <p>
          Information on this site describes our current plans for Tarmoto.
          Dates, pricing, and feature scope are <em>directional</em> — they may
          change. We'll keep this page and the roadmap section honest as plans
          evolve.
        </p>

        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          Don't try to abuse the waitlist or test our patience: no automated
          signups, no impersonation, no submitting addresses you don't own.
          We may remove abusive submissions.
        </p>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The service is provided as-is during the prelaunch period. We do our
          best to keep it running, but we can't promise uptime or guarantees
          that fit a paid product yet.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We'll update this page if the terms change in a meaningful way. The
          definitive version is what you see here at the moment you read it.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the Czech Republic, where
          Studio81 Labs, s.r.o. is registered.
        </p>

        <p class="subpage-meta">
          Prelaunch terms — to be superseded by a full Terms of Service before
          public launch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>
